WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:08.187
In June 2016, Parliament passed Bill C-14, establishing the legal framework for Medical Assistance in Dying.

00:00:08.137 --> 00:00:14.668
A core safeguard within this initial legislation was that a patient's natural death had to be 'reasonably foreseeable'.

00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:19.872
In the first year of the program, 1,018 individuals utilized MAID.
